 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hello there! How's your day treating you?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.38,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_25"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty well, actually.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.73,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_04"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I've got a cupboard full of kitchen gadgets I never use. Spiralizer, waffle maker, and three blenders.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.24,
   "block": "cleaning.dlg26",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Sounds like a museum. A quick test, when did you last use each one?",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.69,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cleaning.dlg26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "So Jamal, are we having your mum's lasagne or mine on Sunday?",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 1.12,
   "block": "nq_home_014",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "other_name",
   "phrasing": "nq_home_014",
   "name_pos": "start",
   "addressee": "Jamal"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "other",
   "text": "Hers. Don't tell her I said that.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.48,
   "block": "nq_home_014"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Honestly? The spiralizer was a January thing. Two years ago.",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 1.34,
   "block": "cleaning.dlg26",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then it can go. If you haven't touched something in a year, and it's not seasonal, it's probably clutter.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 1.17,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cleaning.dlg26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "The waffle maker is for when my nieces visit.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.99,
   "block": "cleaning.dlg26",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's a keeper then, it has a job. But three blenders is two too many.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.69,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cleaning.dlg26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Fair. I'll keep the",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.39,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "cleaning.dlg26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "the good one and donate the rest.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 2.57,
   "block": "cleaning.dlg26",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
